---
InheritParentConfig: true

# Test TUs are the slowest in the tree, and clang-analyzer's symbolic execution
# more than doubles them — it sets the floor on what a PR touching a test
# header costs in CI. Tests don't ship, so the analyzer earns least here. It
# still runs over src/, where a finding reaches production.
Checks: >
  -clang-analyzer-*
...
